---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro"; import Photo from "../components/Photo.astro"; import { hasImg } from "../img"; import { staff } from "../config";
---
<Base title="About Us">
<section class="page-h"><div class="wrap"><h1>About Us</h1><p class="lede">Taking the Gospel to the unreached, serving communities at their level.</p></div></section>

<section class="wrap prose"><h2>Who We Are</h2>
<p>Bible Believers Christ Church is a Gospel-centered outreach committed to taking the Gospel of Jesus Christ to the unreached, serving communities at their level, and establishing vibrant, Bible-believing local churches.</p>
<p>We believe that true, lasting transformation happens when the message of salvation is preached with practical Christ-like compassion. Through our holistic outreach programs, we meet immediate physical, relational, and economic needs, opening doors for the Gospel to be heard, believed, and lived out.</p></section>

<section class="wrap prose"><h2>Our Mandate and Biblical Foundation</h2>
<p>Our ministry is anchored in three foundational Scriptures that drive everything we do:</p>
<blockquote class="scripture">
<p><sup>37</sup>“Then these righteous ones will reply, ‘Lord, when did we ever see you hungry and feed you? Or thirsty and give you something to drink? <sup>38</sup>Or a stranger and show you hospitality? Or naked and give you clothing? <sup>39</sup>When did we ever see you sick or in prison and visit you?’</p>
<p><sup>40</sup>“And the King will say, ‘I tell you the truth, when you did it to one of the least of these my brothers and sisters you were doing it to me!</p>
<cite>Matthew 25:37-40</cite></blockquote>
<blockquote class="scripture">
<p>“And Jesus came and spoke to them, saying, ‘All authority has been given to Me in heaven and on earth. Go therefore and make disciples of all the nations, baptizing them in the name of the Father and of the Son and of the Holy Spirit, teaching them to observe all things that I have commanded you…’”</p>
<cite>Matthew 28:18–20</cite></blockquote>
<blockquote class="scripture">
<p>“How then shall they call on Him in whom they have not believed? And how shall they believe in Him of whom they have not heard? And how shall they hear without a preacher?”</p>
<cite>Romans 10:14 (NKJV)</cite></blockquote>
<p class="closer">We exist to send, preach, and plant—ensuring that every community has access to the life-changing truth of Jesus Christ.</p></section>

<section class="wrap"><h2 class="sh">Vision and Mission</h2></section>
<section class="wrap vm vm-tight">
 <div><h2>Our Vision</h2><p>To serve people at their level, demonstrating Christ’s love through holistic ministry—restoring families, empowering communities, and transforming lives to plant flourishing, Bible-believing local churches.</p></div>
 <div><h2>Our Mission</h2><p>To fulfill the Great Commission by proclaiming Jesus Christ through practical compassion, hands-on skill development, clean water, Nuru Children’s home and community restoration, ensuring every soul has the opportunity to hear, believe, and grow in faith.</p></div>
</section>
<section class="wrap prose"><p><a class="link" href="/beliefs">What we believe</a> · <a class="link" href="/ministries">See all five pillars</a></p></section>

<section class="wrap"><h2 class="sh">Our staff</h2>
<ol class="staff">{staff.map(s=>(<li>{hasImg(s.img) && <Photo src={s.img} alt={s.name} class="sph" pos={s.pos}/>}<h3>{s.name}</h3><p>{s.role}</p></li>))}</ol></section>
</Base>
